<article class="env-situation" id="08KH">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/08KH">Situation <span data-tag="08KH">15.6.1</span>.</a> In the following we will consider ring maps </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ B \ar[r] &  A &  A' \ar[l] }  \]
</div>
  <p> where we assume $A' \to A$ is surjective with kernel $I$. In this situation we set $B' = B \times _ A A'$ to obtain a cartesian square </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ A &  A' \ar[l] \\  B \ar[u] &  B' \ar[l] \ar[u] }  \]
</div>
